{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即不厭生死也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即住無生法忍者也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即五常也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此指根本識也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此指三賢位，以比觀智觀察也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此指初地，以現量智\n證真如也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此指修道，以上十一地處說也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "所謂佛性者，十一地菩薩如隔縠觀月，不能了了見。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此即執取相，指人執分別。二乘、信地同得人空，故能離也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此即相續相，指法執分別。歷三賢至初地，證法空故，故能究竟離也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此即智相，乃法執俱生，二地至七地方離"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此三細中現相，以第八地現形，不滯心迹，故能離之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此即轉相，以九地說法，不滯言\n詮，故能離之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此即業相，金剛定一念相應，故能離也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即無明也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此言無明，地上分離，佛圓離故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "知即心王，緣即心所"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "指三細相"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂不同心王心所相應也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此後能礙得名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此從所礙得名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "徵二礙之所以，向下雙釋"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此釋煩惱礙也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此釋智礙"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "施端內外"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三種律儀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三種忍義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即三精進"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即普明王"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此中亦含此行\n萬里之義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "後真諦記并密教不全書，\n但云記云密也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此上言即某菩薩者，依顯教釋。"}
